      "effect": "4 Level 5 monsters\nOnce per turn (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it. If this card battles an opponent's monster, during damage calculation: This card's ATK/DEF become that opponent's monster's ATK or DEF (whichever is higher) +100 during damage calculation only. If this card destroys a monster by battle: Send 1 random card from your opponent's hand to the GY, and if you do, halve your opponent's LP.",
